{"3683570": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Slime Lab", "steam_appid": 3683570, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Become a Slime Scientist</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is your own lab where all the slime-making happens. You’ve got everything you need to mix, stretch, and get creative. Combine ingredients to create your own slime from scratch. Experiment to find your favorite formula!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683570/extras/5c84949d82d060e3c2ed3ce730ebaeb1.poster.avif?t=1788221872\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683570/extras/5c84949d82d060e3c2ed3ce730ebaeb1.webm?t=1788221872\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683570/extras/5c84949d82d060e3c2ed3ce730ebaeb1.mp4?t=1788221872\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customize Your Slime</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slime can be anything you want it to be. Shape it into food, create slime pets, or make something entirely your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683570/extras/cb54d9afc39fc366680df93f47163da0.poster.avif?t=1788221872\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683570/extras/cb54d9afc39fc366680df93f47163da0.webm?t=1788221872\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683570/extras/cb54d9afc39fc366680df93f47163da0.mp4?t=1788221872\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are endless combinations!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play around with tons of colors</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add charms, glow effects, and tweak the stickiness</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Melt it down or freeze it into a new shape</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whatever theme you're feeling, you've got the charms to match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683570/extras/a2f7711c09c6a42dec868892f1bb5caa.poster.avif?t=1788221872\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683570/extras/a2f7711c09c6a42dec868892f1bb5caa.webm?t=1788221872\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683570/extras/a2f7711c09c6a42dec868892f1bb5caa.mp4?t=1788221872\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fulfill Customer Orders</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customers are counting on you! Match their orders as best you can, and see how your creations measure up.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Run the Lab</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your lab stocked and running. Order supplies, upgrade your tools, and unlock new ingredients. The better your setup, the more you can create.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Become a Slime Scientist</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is your own lab where all the slime-making happens. You’ve got everything you need to mix, stretch, and get creative. Combine ingredients to create your own slime from scratch. Experiment to find your favorite formula!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683570/extras/5c84949d82d060e3c2ed3ce730ebaeb1.poster.avif?t=1788221872\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683570/extras/5c84949d82d060e3c2ed3ce730ebaeb1.webm?t=1788221872\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683570/extras/5c84949d82d060e3c2ed3ce730ebaeb1.mp4?t=1788221872\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customize Your Slime</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slime can be anything you want it to be. Shape it into food, create slime pets, or make something entirely your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683570/extras/cb54d9afc39fc366680df93f47163da0.poster.avif?t=1788221872\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683570/extras/cb54d9afc39fc366680df93f47163da0.webm?t=1788221872\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683570/extras/cb54d9afc39fc366680df93f47163da0.mp4?t=1788221872\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are endless combinations!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play around with tons of colors</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add charms, glow effects, and tweak the stickiness</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Melt it down or freeze it into a new shape</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whatever theme you're feeling, you've got the charms to match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683570/extras/a2f7711c09c6a42dec868892f1bb5caa.poster.avif?t=1788221872\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683570/extras/a2f7711c09c6a42dec868892f1bb5caa.webm?t=1788221872\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683570/extras/a2f7711c09c6a42dec868892f1bb5caa.mp4?t=1788221872\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fulfill Customer Orders</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customers are counting on you! Match their orders as best you can, and see how your creations measure up.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Run the Lab</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your lab stocked and running. Order supplies, upgrade your tools, and unlock new ingredients. The better your setup, the more you can create.</p>", "short_description": "Become a slime scientist in your own VR lab and play with the most satisfying slimes! Experiment with fluid physics to create endless combinations, using unique colors and charms for your next customer.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Polish, Russian, Spanish - Latin America<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683570/c03ef1bf2807e8d6afba5e04b924668ea3f432e3/header.jpg?t=1788221872", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683570/fdd3cff4103854879f892b218b7c2d2eb984b60e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788221872", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683570/fdd3cff4103854879f892b218b7c2d2eb984b60e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788221872", "website": "https://retrocell.dev/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 (64‑bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5-4590 / AMD